{"title":"2006 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 12","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_WhyMath\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by WhyMath</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Antonette gets <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/4/aa4c1a3a8cac685385a2cb0b9459671466814a21.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$70 \\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"35\" height=\"16\" /> on a 10-problem test, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/c/87cc18e719d1a8e2cf150e5e347aa7958f8035d3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$80 \\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> on a 20-problem test and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/f/16f96f13ccefc8551b345cf2752f88a2c1e37f13.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$90 \\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> on a 30-problem test. If the three tests are combined into one 60-problem test, which percent is closest to her overall score? \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/6/3c6c266033be7b2ac9daea913ed1aef7ed3fc63d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 40\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 77\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 80\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 83\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 87$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"394\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/4/f143efcb0f8bae68a672dbdcbbb8b76193de07e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$70 \\% \\cdot 10=7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"98\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/6/266bcd854f54d27f867a716f738837c93645c62c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$80 \\% \\cdot 20=16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"106\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/c/d2ce826027267135e367c2487d760f72a5cbcbab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$90 \\% \\cdot 30=27$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"107\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>Adding them up gets <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/f/55ffba184bab9d55d3e9a4b12c7a56f95671ecf3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7+16+27=50$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"131\" height=\"14\" />. The overall percentage correct would be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/6/da640ffa838a1145d8be818100bf7871a7ac485e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{50}{60}=\\frac{5}{6}=5 \\cdot 16.\\overline{6}=83.\\overline{3} \\approx \\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ 83}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"284\" height=\"37\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_WhyMath\">Video Solution by WhyMath</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by WhyMath\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/6GetTV9Mnmo\">https://youtu.be/6GetTV9Mnmo</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_8\" title=\"2006 AMC 8\">2006 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"2006 AMC 8 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_8_Answer_Key\" title=\"2006 AMC 8 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=2006\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2006 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 11\">Problem 11</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2006 AMC 8 Problems/Prob